      "method_key": "successful_outcome:5",
      "source_line": 185,
      "original_text": "⑤用神入库者，以冲库之时为应期；",
      "excerpt_sha256": "43840a7d229e2ac4b018e3528725710b47f2249c1b71461a240b2fa491a9f736",
