      "method_key": "successful_outcome:6",
      "source_line": 186,
      "original_text": "⑥用神逢刑、冲者，以合时为应期；",
      "excerpt_sha256": "f532ea101ef53363665f4e25b573486981fd9c8df1eb8a559cba3e8e209bd37a",
      "conditions": {
