    {
      "category": "successful_outcome",
      "method_key": "successful_outcome:8",
      "source_line": 188,
      "original_text": "⑧值使门落宫或时干落宫，该宫所含的数，往往是事物成败的期限，即所需的时间，比如几年、几月、几日、几时等。值使门或时干落宫所临之干，有时也是应期。",
      "excerpt_sha256": "a04de02126a0f87f657895ea9bab43c8d43ff6811e3f915245fa14994c14acb2",
      "conditions": {
        "after_success_failure_is_classified": true,
